Caution: Avoid contact with eyes. In case of contact with eyes, rinse immediately with water, For external use only, If an allergic reaction or irritation occurs, discontinue use

Is perfectly smooth skin on the face and body possible? Inspired by the beauty of runway models, Dior's elite cosmetics Creative Director, Peter Philips, developed a foundation. The concept is simple: to create a deeply rested look, as if you've just had a relaxing massage. This product allows you to control the color intensity, from light and weightless to full coverage. It forms an invisible mesh on the skin, ensuring exceptional makeup endurance even under extreme conditions.

Features of Christian Dior Backstage Face & Body Foundation:

- Available in a palette of 21 shades, with 6 undertones and 16 intensity variations;
- Fluid consistency;
- "Second skin" effect;
- Even distribution without blotching or creating a mask-like effect;
- Lightweight coverage that doesn't dry out the skin or clog pores;
- Maintains perfect condition in water, during workouts, and in high humidity;
- Enhances the natural radiance and beauty of the face;
- Layers well;
- Conceals imperfections;
- Doesn't highlight flakiness or settle into fine lines;
- Leaves the skin silky smooth and incredibly fresh.

Light coverage: apply with fingertips, gently patting the texture into the skin. Medium coverage: apply 2 layers of the foundation using the brush, working from the center to the edges of the face. Full-coverage: apply 3 layers of the foundation in circular motions.

CHANEL Sublimage L'essence de Teint/ Ultimate Radiance-Generating Serum Foundation 40ml
&nbsp;
With a unique texture that fuses with the skin, the first serum foundation by CHANEL concentrates the benefits of Vanilla Planifolia and the power of a radiance generator. Unprecedented for a foundation, its formula combines light-reflecting particles and pigments to deliver immediate radiance that lasts all day long. Its serum-like texture is luscious yet lightweight and fresh. It melts into the skin to make it look smoother and reveal its radiance with a sheer finish. The signature brush ensures subtle, personalised application for buildable coverage. The complexion is sublime, with a luminous finish. Skin is perfectly hydrated, comfortable and protected from external aggressors.
&nbsp;
- Apply a drop of foundation onto the top of your hand and take a pearl-sized amount of SUBLIMAGE L&rsquo;ESSENCE DE TEINT with the tip of the signature brush. - Dab the serum foundation onto each cheek, the forehead, the chin and the neck. Then, smooth over face, from the centre outwards.- Even out with circular movements.- For buildable coverage, work more foundation onto the face.

L.A. Colors Truly Matte Foundation CLM353 Nude 40ml (1.35 fl oz) is a foundation that offers oil control and flawless coverage. In fact, it boasts a high-pigmented but lightweight formula that leaves a matte finish on the skin. Thanks to its high coverage, this foundation easily conceals imperfections and evens out the skin tone, ensuring a flawless look that lasts all day. It glides on as a liquid but transforms into a matte, powder-like finish, helping to reduce excess shine on the skin. Moreover, its long-wearing properties make it an ideal choice for those looking to maintain a perfect matte appearance without the need for frequent touch-ups.
Perfect for application with either a wet blending sponge or a makeup brush, this foundation blends effortlessly into the skin, allowing for flawless coverage. Additionally, for best results, pair it with a face primer, for extra long-wear! Last but not least, the packaging is also worth mentioning. The inclusion of a pump top ensures a clean, mess-free application every time, dispensing just the right amount of product. So, whether you're facing a long day at work or a night out on the town, this foundation stands up to the challenge, keeping your complexion looking its best. Its matte finish effectively minimizes the appearance of excess oil, leaving the skin with a smooth, refined look. All in all, this foundation is sure to impress with its coverage, lasting wear, and stunning matte finish. So, embrace the confidence that comes with a perfectly matte complexion, and let your natural beauty shine through.


Characteristics

Shade name: CLM353 Nude;
Coverage: full;
Finish: matte;
Texture: liquid;
Good for: combination to oily skin, mattifying the skin;
Longevity: long-lasting;
Presentation: bottle with pump dispenser.



How to use
Apply an appropriate amount of L.A. Colors Truly Matte Foundation CLM353 Nude 40ml (1.35 fl oz) and blend with a sponge, brush, or your fingers. For best results, combine it with the L.A. Colors Face Primer.

