TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion Foundation 17N Vanilla 18g (0.63oz) provides buildable coverage that evens skin tone and conceals imperfections with a lightweight, comfortable formula. This cushion foundation blends seamlessly into the skin, creating a natural, semi-matte finish that lasts throughout the day. The formula contains Hyaluronic Acid, which helps maintain moisture levels and supports skin hydration. In addition, Botanical Extracts work to nourish the skin while the foundation provides coverage. As a result, the complexion appears smooth and even without feeling heavy or uncomfortable. This foundation offers up to 72 hours of wear, maintaining its coverage without fading or settling into fine lines. Furthermore, the breathable texture prevents the cakey appearance that often occurs with full-coverage products.
The cushion applicator allows for precise, buildable application. Therefore, coverage can be adjusted from medium to full depending on preference. The formula blurs the appearance of pores and smooths skin texture, creating an even canvas. This foundation works well for sensitive and acne-prone skin types. The lightweight consistency does not clog pores or cause irritation. Moreover, the hydrating ingredients help prevent the dryness that some long-wear foundations can cause. The formula maintains its finish throughout the day without requiring frequent touch-ups. However, the natural semi-matte appearance still allows the skin to look healthy rather than flat or overly matte.
Characteristics

Shade: 17N Vanilla;
Coverage / Color payoff: buildable;
Finish: natural;
Texture: cushion;
Longevity: up to 72 hours;
Presentation: red compact with a mirror and sponge applicator;
Formulated without: alcohol, parabens.

Main Ingredients

Hyaluronic Acid maintains moisture levels and supports skin hydration;
Botanical Extracts nourish the skin and support overall skin health.

How to use
Apply TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion Foundation 17N Vanilla 18g (0.63oz) by using the puff included in the product. Before applying the product onto the skin, tap the puff into the built-in palette to reduce the amount of product and distribute it more evenly. Then, apply using tapping motions.

