IT Cosmetics Your Skin But Better Foundation + Skincare 52 Rich Warn 30ml (1floz) offers a revolutionary formula that improves your skin's appearance while providing coverage. Perfect for those seeking a natural, radiant finish, this product goes beyond traditional foundation to enhance your skincare routine.

Key features include:

Buildable medium coverage that minimizes the look of pores and imperfections;
All-day hydration suitable for all skin types;
Infused with skin-loving ingredients like hyaluronic acid, aloe vera extract, and vitamins E & B5;
Improves skin texture and tone in just two weeks of use;
Delivers a natural radiant finish while caring for your skin throughout the day.

The Dior Backstage Face &amp; Body Foundation is the Dior Make-up Artists' secret weapon for a flawless complexion, thanks to its ultra-variable coverage, from a naturally transparent glow to perfect coverage.
The Dior Backstage Face &amp; Body Foundation has been tested and 100% confirmed by professional Dior Make-up Artists.

&nbsp;

* With its liquid texture and second-skin effect, this variable foundation offers a tailor-made intensity.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Enriched with beautifying pigments, the formula melts with the skin and gives the skin a perfect, natural complexion in nature and through the camera lens.

&nbsp;

The waterproof formula of the Dior Backstage Face &amp; Body Foundation lies like an invisible net on the skin and withstands even extreme conditions: sport, water, extreme temperatures, high humidity.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

It even survives the glaring headlights backstage and on the catwalk
